            <div class="text-center mt-8">
                <a href="/blog" class="inline-block font-bold uppercase text-sm rounded-full border-2 px-8 py-3 transition hover:bg-gray-900 hover:text-white" style="border-color: #1B2A4A; color: #1B2A4A;">View All Articles</a>
